          deckDescription: 'Three standard 52-card French packs plus six jokers (162 cards total). Used for Canastone (Italian Canasta). Only red versus black matters in some variants; special red-disc and black-disc cards exist. Jokers and twos are wild; threes have special scoring and blocking roles.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits per pack: Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades. In Canastone only color (red or black) matters for some rules; special decks may show red or black discs instead.',
